  "notes": "Waiver filing (Exhibit A, cash receipts and disbursements by fund, period 10/1/23-9/30/24; page 2a not in trim, page 1a shows no disbursements for its funds). Governmental = General, Street, 13th Street Revenue Bond Payment, 13th Street Letter of Conditions, General Savings; business-type = Water, Water Revenue Bond Payment, Sewer, Water Debt Reserve, Water System Surplus, Water Letter of Conditions, and the Certificate of Deposit #105290 column (mixed Street/Water/Sewer CD, majority utility; see decision_needed). Beginning/ending cash are line 3 / line 24 balances (net cash + investments); investments shown separately for info. Transfers per schedule p4: General ARPA to Water 2,371.14 (governmental to business-type); others within each fund type. Solid Waste 228.00 is in the General Fund column (kept governmental). USDA-RD debt outstanding 906,816.10 (p4) not on the cash statement. County treasurer balance 843.07 at 10/1/23 and 2,247.92 at 9/30/24 printed below the statement, not in the roll-forward. No supplementary schedules. Read pages 1-4 of 4"
